OL,3,GNEWSADrivers worried after rocks thrown
OL,4,Aat buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus company has had to alter routes
OL,7,Fafter rocks were thrown at vehicles.
OL,9,FStagecoach buses running through the
OL,10,FRectory Farm area of Northampton have
OL,11,Fhad to alter routes on and off over the
OL,12,Fpast year, with the latest in
OL,13,FSeptember, due to young people
OL,14,Flaunching rocks, stones and conkers.
OL,16,FThe decision was made for driver and
OL,17,Fpassenger safety, the company said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
